flutter_edge_ai (patch_c_api.sh section 10b): on Apple, LiteRT's GPU registry
registers only the accelerator linked into libLiteRtLm and never dlopens one.
Up to native-v0.19.1 this patch put our LiteRtLmMetalAccelerator.framework
first and turned off the default lookup; from native-v0.20.0 no Metal
framework ships (0.20 migration decision D1), so the whole library loop is
compiled out on Apple. An unregistered static accelerator is an error, not a
search: flutter_litert's accelerator in the same app crashed when registered
into this environment. Non-Apple targets are unchanged.

diff --git a/litert/runtime/accelerators/gpu_registry.cc b/litert/runtime/accelerators/gpu_registry.cc
